config BR2_PACKAGE_DISC_STOCK_BLOBS
	bool "disc-stock-blobs"
	help
	  From FiiO's official V2.57 OTA (downloaded, decrypted, sha256
	  checked): the stock GPL kernel modules and the radio firmware,
	  installed to the target; the stock kernel (xImage) and the
	  stock rootfs padded to 96 MiB (for disc-flash stock), installed
	  to the images directory. Nothing of it is kept in this tree.
